# Logs produced by lint, simulation, build and other tools
*.log
*.log.*

# Local tool caches and browser preview state
**/.test_tmp/
**/.chrome-preview/
**/Crashpad/

# Generated build products
**/build/
**/obj/
**/obj_dir/
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.dll
